        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-310 (ensure controlled execution — Exception Monitoring &amp; Investigation (PA-23.1).) | - operational: National LP Director review and approval gate
Owner: National LP Director</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
